/10/26/barnes-group-inc-b-q3-2018-earnings-conference-cal.aspx"},{"c":"B 2018 Q3","e":"b","d":"2018-10-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Patrick J. Dempsey","x":"…have been doing a wonderful job in terms of mitigating any potential headwinds that we're anticipating and that they're doing through a number of different activities including pass through of pricing, looking at the supply chain with a view to what alternative supplies we may be able to pursue.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/26/barnes-group-inc-b-q3-2018-earnings-conference-cal.aspx"},{"c":"B 2018 Q3","e":"b","d":"2018-10-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Christopher J. Stephens","x":"…basis, excluding IGS short term purchase accounting adjustments and acquisition transaction costs this year and FOBOHA short term purchase accounting adjustments and restructuring expenses last year, adjusted operating profit of $34.9 million was up 12% from an adjusted $31.1 million a year ago.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/26/barnes-group-inc-b-q3-2018-earnings-conference-cal.aspx"},{"c":"B 2018 Q4","e":"b","d":"2019-02-22","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Patrick Dempsey","x":"In automotive-related markets, however, we're seeing softness in light-vehicle production rates impacting engineered components, while ongoing tensions due to tariffs are impacting our Force & Motion Control and molding solutions businesses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/22/barnes-group-b-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"B 2018 Q4","e":"b","d":"2019-02-22","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Patrick Dempsey","x":"A further concern is if incremental auto parts and light vehicle tariffs are implemented, we would expect additional pressure on automotive end markets.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/22/barnes-group-b-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"B 2018 Q4","e":"b","d":"2019-02-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Chris Stephens","x":"For the fourth quarter of 2017, adjusted EPS excludes a $1.79 charge related to U.S. tax law changes and $0.02 per share charge related to restructuring actions within our industrial segment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/22/barnes-group-b-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"B 2018 Q4","e":"b","d":"2019-02-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Chris Stephens","x":"For 2017, adjusted EPS excludes a $1.77 charge related to tax law changes, $0.03 of [Inaudible] short-term purchase accounting adjustments, and $0.01 benefit from restructuring actions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/22/barnes-group-b-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"B 2019 Q1","e":"b","d":"2019-04-26","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Patrick J. Dempsey","x":"Softness in demand for automotive hot runners was driven by delays in automotive model changes and new model introductions primarily as a result of uncertainty caused by ongoing trade and tariff concerns.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/26/barnes-group-inc-b-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"B 2019 Q1","e":"b","d":"2019-04-26","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Patrick J. Dempsey","x":"And with that, not that there will be an immediate lift of those tariffs but that there will be a lift of the uncertainty that's hanging over our customer base with a view to them moving forward with more confidence in terms of their business investments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/26/barnes-group-inc-b-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"B 2019 Q1","e":"b","d":"2019-04-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Patrick J. Dempsey","x":"In order to better align our production with current market conditions, this has necessitated the implementation of a wide range of cost-saving initiatives including adjustments to the workforce.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/26/barnes-group-inc-b-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"B 2019 Q1","e":"b","d":"2019-04-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Patrick J. Dempsey","x":"Operating profit was $21.5 million, down 34% primarily driven by the impacts of lower organic sales volumes, unfavorable productivity driven by the costs associated with the workforce -- a reduction in workforce and short-term purchase accounting adjustments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/26/barnes-group-inc-b-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"B 2019 Q2","e":"b","d":"2019-07-26","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Patrick J. Dempsey","x":"What we're seeing right now our model change has been released, even with the hangover the tariff issue and the trade disputes hanging over them.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/26/barnes-group-inc-b-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"B 2019 Q2","e":"b","d":"2019-07-26","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Patrick J. Dempsey","x":"And then you have internally, you have the releases that would come from the domestic Chinese which are not impacted by that is the tariff disputes because their domestic production domestic sales.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/26/barnes-group-inc-b-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"B 2019 Q2","e":"b","d":"2019-07-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Michael Ciarmoli","x":"And then should we think about you kind of talked about initiatives to right size, how should we think about some of those costs are they going to be meaningful.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/26/barnes-group-inc-b-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"B 2019 Q3","e":"b","d":"2019-10-25","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Pete Skibitski","x":"And just keeping it to Molding Solutions, I know that US kind of tariff discussions are ongoing, but I would think at some point, the auto OEMs will have to come out with new models and I know there are various kind of flavors of model changes.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/25/barnes-group-inc-b-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"B 2019 Q3","e":"b","d":"2019-10-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Patrick J. Dempsey","x":"…a really nice job in terms of ramping up to the new requirements, positioning ourselves on new strategic platforms for the long term and then driving the Barnes Enterprise System to introduce those new products through our NPI process and then starting to streamline them in terms of production.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/25/barnes-group-inc-b-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"B 2019 Q3","e":"b","d":"2019-10-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Patrick J. Dempsey","x":"…I think we've become much more disciplined on is understanding our manufacturing capacities worldwide and understanding how we might take advantage in some instances of a -- more challenging environment to maximize and streamline how we're running our overall manufacturing production systems.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/25/barnes-group-inc-b-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"B 2019 Q4","e":"b","d":"2020-02-21","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Patrick J. Dempsey","x":"…in the right direction was the signing of the trade agreement in the first quarter in January between the U.S. and China, not so much because it lifted the tariffs immediately, but more because it sent a clear signal of alleviating some of the business uncertainty and that progress has been made.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/21/barnes-group-inc-b-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"B 2019 Q4","e":"b","d":"2020-02-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Patrick J. Dempsey","x":"What the team has continued to do is streamline the whole process of NPI within our Aerospace business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/21/barnes-group-inc-b-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"B 2020 Q1","e":"b","d":"2020-04-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Patrick J. Dempsey","x":"So, we've been very proactive and aggressive, I would suggest, in terms of our cost reduction efforts.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/24/barnes-group-inc-b-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"B 2020 Q1","e":"b","d":"2020-04-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Christopher J. Stephens","x":"From a global footprint point of view, we don't feel we're in a situation to have a capacity concern for purposes of a restructuring and consolidation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/24/barnes-group-inc-b-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"B 2020 Q1","e":"b","d":"2020-04-24","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Christopher J. Stephens","x":"When the depth of the disruption and the pace of recovery in our critical end markets become clear, we will reiterate our full year outlook.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/24/barnes-group-inc-b-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"B 2020 Q2","e":"b","d":"2020-07-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Patrick J. Dempsey","x":"In such a challenging environment, cost reduction and cash preservation efforts became paramount.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/28/barnes-group-inc-b-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"B 2020 Q2","e":"b","d":"2020-07-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Patrick J. Dempsey","x":"Unfortunately, this necessitated Companywide restructuring efforts, which will lead to a reduction of approximately 8% of our global workforce.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/28/barnes-group-inc-b-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"B 2020 Q3","e":"b","d":"2020-10-23","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Patrick J. Dempsey","x":"The model change side of the equation has gotten caught over the last couple of years in term -- caught in this whole mix of what was initially the tariff war that was going on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/23/barnes-group-inc-b-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"B 2020 Q3","e":"b","d":"2020-10-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Christopher J. Stephens","x":"On an adjusted basis, excluding $300,000 in restructuring charges, operating margin was 9.9%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/23/barnes-group-inc-b-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"B 2020 Q3","e":"b","d":"2020-10-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Christopher J. Stephens","x":"So Tim, as we mentioned last quarter, of the restructuring charge, the $18 million that we actually took in the second quarter, we expected $30 million in cost savings on an annualized basis.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/23/barnes-group-inc-b-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"B 2020 Q4","e":"b","d":"2021-02-19","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Patrick J. Dempsey","x":"But the -- to put it in context, on our Aerospace side, recognize that most of our raw materials are pass through on pre-negotiated prices.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/19/barnes-group-inc-b-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"B 2020 Q4","e":"b","d":"2021-02-19","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Patrick J. Dempsey","x":"But at the same time, on the sales side, working equally as hard to ensure that we're passing those through to our end customers so that we're not caught in the middle, so to speak.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/19/barnes-group-inc-b-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"B 2020 Q4","e":"b","d":"2021-02-19","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Marian Acker","x":"Adjusted net income per share in the fourth quarter of 2020 excludes $0.01 of residual restructuring charges from previously announced actions with most of the impact reflected in other expense not operating profit.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/19/barnes-group-inc-b-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"B 2020 Q4","e":"b","d":"2021-02-19","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Marian Acker","x":"Adjusted earnings per share for 2020 excludes $0.27 of restructuring costs and $0.13 of Seeger divestiture adjustments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/19/barnes-group-inc-b-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"B 2021 Q1","e":"b","d":"2021-04-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Patrick J. Dempsey","x":"Relative to your question about pass through then to our end customers, I think that has been addressed very proactively by the team on a case-by-case basis, it's not by any means a 100% pass through, but the teams are working it every day with a view to wherever there is an open in a particular…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/30/barnes-group-inc-b-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"B 2021 Q1","e":"b","d":"2021-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Marian Acker","x":"At this point, we're not anticipating significant residual restructuring charges to come through, so no forecasted adjustments to 2021 net income.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/30/barnes-group-inc-b-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"B 2021 Q1","e":"b","d":"2021-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Pete Skibitski","x":"So it sounds like you're saying cost takeout benefited the first quarter in Aerospace and maybe some corporate allocation shift, but that it, the guidance implies you're going to kind of be flat to down the balance of the year margin wise at Aerospace.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/30/barnes-group-inc-b-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"B 2021 Q1","e":"b","d":"2021-04-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Patrick J. Dempsey","x":"While we previously envision business improving as the year progressed, now with the stronger momentum exiting the first quarter, we have increased our outlook for the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/30/barnes-group-inc-b-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"B 2021 Q2","e":"b","d":"2021-07-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Julie K. Streich","x":"On an adjusted basis, which excludes restructuring charges of $700,000 this year and $17.7 million last year, operating income of $39.2 million was up 41% and adjusted operating margin of 12.2% was up 40 basis points from a year ago.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/31/barnes-group-inc-b-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"B 2021 Q2","e":"b","d":"2021-07-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Julie K. Streich","x":"Adjusted net income per share in the current quarter excludes $0.01 of restructuring charges and a net foreign tax benefit of $0.04, while the prior-year period excludes $0.26 of restructuring charges.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/31/barnes-group-inc-b-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"B 2021 Q3","e":"b","d":"2021-10-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Patrick J. Dempsey","x":"Inflationary pressures have been mitigated to the extent possible through pricing actions and raw material pass-through arrangements.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/29/barnes-group-inc-b-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"B 2021 Q3","e":"b","d":"2021-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Patrick J. Dempsey","x":"Our Barnes Enterprise System has been employed to create various cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/29/barnes-group-inc-b-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"B 20